{"id":"1291a10d1576d0d7","group":"93","path":"93/93-fact-commutator-trivial.md","title":"Commutator Trivial","display":"Commutator Trivial","type":"fact","metadata":{"type":"fact","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-fact-commutator-trivial","aliases":["93-fact-commutator-trivial"],"display":"Commutator Trivial","depends_on":["[[93-df-commutator]]","[[93-df-boolean-algebra]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"fact"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-fact-commutator-trivial"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-fact-commutator-trivial</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Commutator Trivial"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"18ca772ab524a46f\" href=\"?note=18ca772ab524a46f\" title=\"93-df-commutator\">93-df-commutator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7087f500cc845c3b\" href=\"?note=7087f500cc845c3b\" title=\"93-df-boolean-algebra\">93-df-boolean-algebra</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\">\\(\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[-,-]\">\\([-,-]\\)</span> is the commutator on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nabla_{\\mathbf A}\">\\(\\nabla_{\\mathbf A}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_{\\mathbf A}\">\\(\\Delta_{\\mathbf A}\\)</span> are the total and diagonal congruences.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}commutator\\text{-}trivial}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\to\n\\bigl([\\nabla_{\\mathbf A},\\nabla_{\\mathbf A}]_{\\mathbf A}=\\nabla_{\\mathbf A}\\land\n[\\Delta_{\\mathbf A},\\Delta_{\\mathbf A}]_{\\mathbf A}=\\Delta_{\\mathbf A}\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}commutator\\text{-}trivial}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\to\n\\bigl([\\nabla_{\\mathbf A},\\nabla_{\\mathbf A}]_{\\mathbf A}=\\nabla_{\\mathbf A}\\land\n[\\Delta_{\\mathbf A},\\Delta_{\\mathbf A}]_{\\mathbf A}=\\Delta_{\\mathbf A}\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>For Boolean algebras the congruence commutator is intersection.  The two\ndisplayed equalities are therefore the top and bottom instances; they do\nnot make a nontrivial Boolean algebra abelian in the sense of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e2be868cf664b716\" href=\"?note=e2be868cf664b716\" title=\"93-df-abelian\">93-df-abelian</a>.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-commutator","status":"resolved","id":"18ca772ab524a46f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-commutator]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-boolean-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"7087f500cc845c3b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-boolean-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-abelian","status":"resolved","id":"e2be868cf664b716","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"For Boolean algebras the congruence commutator is intersection.  The two\ndisplayed equalities are therefore the top and bottom instances; they do\nnot make a nontrivial Boolean algebra abelian in the sense of [[93-df-abelian]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf A)","display":false},{"tex":"[-,-]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\nabla_{\\mathbf A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_{\\mathbf A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}commutator\\text{-}trivial}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\to\n\\bigl([\\nabla_{\\mathbf A},\\nabla_{\\mathbf A}]_{\\mathbf A}=\\nabla_{\\mathbf A}\\land\n[\\Delta_{\\mathbf A},\\Delta_{\\mathbf A}]_{\\mathbf A}=\\Delta_{\\mathbf A}\\bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":988,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["18ca772ab524a46f","7087f500cc845c3b","e2be868cf664b716"]}